  "body": "Fixes:\n- Deeply clone the [[MapData]] List, including creating new Records.\n- Skip empty [[key]] Records.\n\nSimplification:\n- Remove the bail out for a missing [[MapData]] or [[SetData]]\n  internal slot. This cannot fail, as \"is a Map\" (used to set\n  \"deep clone\" to \"map\") implies \"has a [[MapData]] internal slot\".\n",
